  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Access official Microsoft documentation, API references, and code samples for Azure, .NET, Windows, and more.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `microsoft-code-reference` (Find working code samples, verify API signatures, and fix Microsoft SDK errors using official docs), `microsoft-docs` (Understand Microsoft technologies by querying official documentation), `microsoft-skill-creator` (Create agent skills for Microsoft technologies using official documentation)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `microsoft-learn`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install microsoft-docs@claude-plugins-official` from `MicrosoftDocs/mcp`.",
